    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to no.1 Lissadel Park, a beautifully extended 3 bedroom semi detached home ideally located in a private cul de sac opposite a large green. Boasting a light filled interior design with a sunny west facing rear garden this property is situated in a friendly neighbourhood close to a whole host of amenities. \r\n\r\nThe property briefly consists of entrance hall with guest wc, spacious lounge with an open fireplace, open plan kitchen / dining & family area with an abundance of designer fitted units and a utility room. On the first floor there are 3 large bedrooms, master bedroom ensuite and a beautifully tiled family bathroom. The rear garden is a mix of patio and lawn with solid wall boundaries throughout and a large side passage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t               5.18 x 1.67\t       Decorative timber floor, coving, security alarm, radiator cover\r\nWC\t\t                                       Tiled floor & walls, wc, whd\r\n  \r\nLounge\t      5.13 x 3.50\t       Decorative timber floor, open fire, coving, bay window, radiator cover\r\n\t\t\r\nKitchen/ Dining/ Family Room         7.8 x 5.14\t   Decorative timber floor, recently insulated, spotlights, larder unit, fully fitted kitchen units, double oven, gas     hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, fridge freezer, Quooker hot tap, feature length radiator x2, Velux roof light x2, large sliding door to garden\r\n\t\t\r\nUtility\t\t                               Decorative timber floor, gas boiler\r\n \r\n \r\nStairs/Landing\t\t                        Stira Ladder to attic which has been recently insulated, hot press\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom\t2.40 x 2.15\t        Tiled floor & walls, bath suite, mirror, wc, whb, cabinet, spotlights \r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t4.37 x 3.30\t        Mirrored slide robes, radiator cover\r\n\t\t\r\nEnsuite\t        2.47 x 1.27\t        Decorative timber floor, heated rail, partial wall tiles, wc, whb, feature overhead shower, underfloor heating\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t 4.5 x 2.75\t        Fitted wardrobe, bay window\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 3\t 2.82 x 2.42\t        Fitted wardrobe, radiator cover\r\n\t\t\r\n \r\nGarden\t\t                               Side passage, large corner plot patio, walled & fenced, light, tap"
